      "title": "Websocket: Fix leaks of decompressed tvbs",
      "message": "Websocket: Fix leaks of decompressed tvbs\n\nUse tvb_new_child_real_data in order to add the tvb to\nthe chain of creation of the parent, so that the tvb (but\nnot the real data, which is file scoped and stored in packet info)\nis freed when the packet is done dissecting.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2023-09-13T20:41:21.000-04:00",
      "committer_name": "John Thacker",
      "committer_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2023-09-14T03:05:01.000+00:00",
